# Spirit of Mirrors (Q104): a human mystic of level 10, wearing an oak wand of its own, accepts
# at Gallint for three more, and the guards Kenyos and Arnold show it the way. Each of the three
# spirits of mirrors, slain with an oak wand in hand, binds its spirit into a wand (an unworn
# wand is the one taken). Gallint takes the three spiritbound wands for the Wand of Adept, a
# mystic's spiritshots, the newbie spiritshots and the echo crystals, and the quest's end takes
# the worn wand; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q104_spirit_of_mirrors.golden
character Seeker 10
class 10
equip 748
script quest.Q104_SpiritOfMirrors
item 748 1135 1136 1137 747 1060 1835 2509 4412 4413 4414 4415 4416 5790
page default/30017.htm
page guard/30045.htm
page guard/30041.htm
page script/quest/Q104_SpiritOfMirrors/
npc gallint 30017 Folk 10 0 0
npc kenyos 30045 Guard 20 0 0
npc arnold 30041 Guard 30 0 0
npc spirit1 27003 Monster -40 0 0
npc spirit2 27004 Monster 40 0 0
npc spirit3 27005 Monster 0 40 0

# Gallint: accept, three oak wands.
action gallint
action gallint
